WEBVTT

00:00:26.270 --> 00:00:27.080
Ryuji.

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:31.680
This girl looks good in anything.

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:34.250
That's my school's uniform.

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:37.670
Let's go.

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:46.240
School, school.

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:50.390
How convenient the chair of the board is a society affiliate.

00:00:50.390 --> 00:00:51.990
Why didn't you tell me?

00:00:51.990 --> 00:00:53.560
You would have opposed it.

00:00:53.560 --> 00:00:55.030
Of course I would.

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:05.530
Ryuji, I want to go to school, too.

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:09.280
I don't want to be alone.

00:01:09.670 --> 00:01:14.320
Fine, but you can't let anyone find out you're a dragon.

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:17.440
Don't use fire or use your wings.

00:01:17.830 --> 00:01:19.420
Okay!

00:01:23.180 --> 00:01:27.050
Read this. Your level 10 registration application was accepted.

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:31.900
My official data needs to be evaluated.

00:01:32.310 --> 00:01:35.890
They'll send a specialist to your school today.

00:01:35.890 --> 00:01:37.590
There's an interview, too.

00:01:41.610 --> 00:01:44.620
I've got your Slash Breath, too.

00:03:15.940 --> 00:03:23.060
"The Dangerous Test"

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:23.280
Ryuji-kun's late, isn't he?

00:03:25.530 --> 00:03:28.040
Mao-chan, good morning.

00:03:28.830 --> 00:03:29.950
Hey.

00:03:31.550 --> 00:03:33.520
That's a cool watch.

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:39.420
Isn't it great? With this thing, I can find my way home safely from any jungle or desert.

00:03:39.420 --> 00:03:40.760
Not that I have plans to go.

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:43.050
Oh, Ryuji-kun.

00:03:56.300 --> 00:03:57.350
Who is that?

00:03:57.350 --> 00:03:59.480
What a beautiful blonde.

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:01.480
She's the girl from the beach.

00:04:02.310 --> 00:04:04.670
Good to see you again, Misaki-chan.

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:16.660
Rose Kisaragi, 14.

00:04:17.410 --> 00:04:22.390
She came from the United States to stay with her distant relative, Kisaragi-kun.

00:04:22.390 --> 00:04:26.180
She skipped a grade due to her academic excellence.

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:28.870
Rose-san, please introduce yourself.

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:36.170
Say something. Tell them what you like.

00:04:36.900 --> 00:04:40.370
I like ice cream and Ryuji.

00:04:40.370 --> 00:04:41.640
Rose!

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:45.350
No!

00:04:50.360 --> 00:04:52.010
You're right.

00:04:53.030 --> 00:04:57.000
Eto-san, why don't you teach Rose that sort of thing?

00:04:59.810 --> 00:05:02.300
"Plan to Take Back Kisaragi Ryuji"

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:05.270
We have a long day ahead of us.

00:05:07.830 --> 00:05:10.490
Oh, to be young.

00:05:18.440 --> 00:05:20.320
Bianca.

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:25.040
There you are.

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:28.550
A SMAW?

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:55.520
Ryuji-kun!

00:06:00.230 --> 00:06:01.410
Ryuji!

00:06:01.780 --> 00:06:02.860
Ryuji-kun.

00:06:31.580 --> 00:06:35.190
P120, L326...

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:39.540
Your L value is lower than expected.

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:43.660
What are you doing shooting a bazooka in a school?

00:06:43.660 --> 00:06:45.720
This is no bazooka.

00:06:45.720 --> 00:06:48.200
It's a hybrid weapon for testing purposes.

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:52.500
It's not terribly persistent, and the destructive power of the missile has been reduced.

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:57.640
My objective isn't to kill you, but to evaluate you.

00:06:58.280 --> 00:07:00.550
Then you're from the society...

00:07:00.860 --> 00:07:04.990
Member of the San Francisco Lost Precious Research Department...

00:07:05.310 --> 00:07:07.300
Bianca Alexandra Lou.

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:08.500
I'm a level 4.

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:09.800
Ryuji!

00:07:11.150 --> 00:07:12.700
Bianca.

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:14.780
Eriko-san, you know her?

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:19.020
She pointed that bazooka at me a year ago for my examination.

00:07:19.020 --> 00:07:21.020
I told you, it's not a bazooka.

00:07:21.020 --> 00:07:23.760
What did you come here for?

00:07:24.570 --> 00:07:27.040
I won't forgive you if you harm Ryuji!

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:29.700
You're the red dragon I've heard about.

00:07:29.700 --> 00:07:34.070
I'm quite interested in you, but I'm here to examine Kisaragi Ryuji.

00:07:34.070 --> 00:07:35.880
Stay out of my way.

00:07:35.880 --> 00:07:38.470
No. I'll stay by Ryuji.

00:07:38.940 --> 00:07:41.640
You mean you'll interfere with my work?

00:07:44.130 --> 00:07:47.690
Bianca, maybe she could just watch.

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:49.430
I'll keep her under control.

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:53.330
As long as you don't mind, it's fine.

00:07:53.770 --> 00:07:56.280
I don't mind. It can't hurt.

00:07:57.170 --> 00:08:01.220
Be good. I've got a lot of tests to take.

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:02.560
Okay.

00:08:02.760 --> 00:08:04.830
Take off your clothes.

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:11.850
"Do not enter."

00:08:09.900 --> 00:08:11.620
What are they doing?

00:08:12.390 --> 00:08:15.790
Whatever they're up to, that redhead is weird.

00:08:16.270 --> 00:08:17.990
We shouldn't be doing this, Mao-chan.

00:08:18.450 --> 00:08:21.100
It's fine as long as we don't enter.

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:23.120
Sure, but...

00:08:31.120 --> 00:08:32.660
Shall we get started?

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:35.850
You're going to measure me?

00:08:36.210 --> 00:08:37.460
Of course.

00:08:38.570 --> 00:08:40.040
Hurry up and take your clothes off.

00:08:40.720 --> 00:08:41.770
Take his clothes off?

00:08:42.130 --> 00:08:43.770
What are you doing?

00:08:43.770 --> 00:08:45.230
Hurry up.

00:08:45.230 --> 00:08:50.400
It's embarrassing to have your measurements taken by a woman you don't know.

00:08:50.400 --> 00:08:52.150
Do you have to say it like that?

00:08:52.380 --> 00:08:54.910
In that case, Eriko, you do it.

00:08:56.320 --> 00:08:58.290
Sure, I don't mind.

00:08:58.290 --> 00:09:02.600
I'll measure him. I know Ryuji's body well.

00:09:06.630 --> 00:09:09.550
Stop wasting time. Hurry up.

00:09:09.550 --> 00:09:14.140
Wait, I'm not ready for this...

00:09:16.560 --> 00:09:20.610
Ryuji, what are you doing with these beautiful girls from around the world?

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:24.090
A redheaded goddess?

00:09:24.090 --> 00:09:25.710
Cute! Pretty!

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:28.120
I shouldn't have slept in today.

00:09:28.120 --> 00:09:30.200
Why do you get all the girls, Ryuji?

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:33.560
Masato.

00:09:34.960 --> 00:09:39.090
Why do I have to measure another dude's body?

00:09:39.400 --> 00:09:41.060
Sorry.

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:43.670
If I've got to measure someone, I'd rather it be them.

00:09:46.340 --> 00:09:48.860
Stop acting stupid and measure him already!

00:09:48.860 --> 00:09:50.220
Who are you?

00:09:50.200 --> 00:09:52.530
Who is she?

00:09:50.220 --> 00:09:52.160
When did you get here?

00:09:52.160 --> 00:09:55.860
You'll have to leave immediately. Hurry up.

00:09:52.980 --> 00:09:55.840
She's an acquaintance.

00:09:56.060 --> 00:09:57.040
But we...

00:09:57.040 --> 00:09:58.260
The exit is that way.

00:10:05.970 --> 00:10:07.510
"Examination in progress."

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:24.120
A wave.

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:25.670
A circle.

00:10:25.670 --> 00:10:27.320
A triangle.

00:10:27.320 --> 00:10:28.680
A square.

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:33.920
Huh? This shape shouldn't be here.

00:10:49.150 --> 00:10:52.520
"Radiation Controlled Area"

00:11:21.560 --> 00:11:22.550
"Evaluation complete."

00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:26.500
Let's begin the interview.

00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:29.470
You are 15 years old. Is that correct?

00:11:29.470 --> 00:11:31.800
Yes. I turn 16 tomorrow.

00:11:32.140 --> 00:11:34.720
Ryuji-kun's birthday is tomorrow?

00:11:34.720 --> 00:11:36.220
You didn't know?

00:11:36.220 --> 00:11:38.190
I couldn't just ask.

00:11:38.190 --> 00:11:40.190
Your nationality is Japanese.

00:11:40.750 --> 00:11:41.750
Yes.

00:11:41.750 --> 00:11:42.910
What's your blood type?

00:11:43.520 --> 00:11:44.420
What?

00:11:44.420 --> 00:11:46.420
Don't interrupt.

00:11:47.660 --> 00:11:50.500
If you don't want to be removed, go over there.

00:11:50.500 --> 00:11:53.880
Sorry for the trouble she's causing you.

00:11:54.620 --> 00:11:58.890
I understand your beauty very well.

00:11:58.890 --> 00:12:01.600
You're an angel descended from the heavens.

00:12:13.930 --> 00:12:15.520
What is that glove?

00:12:15.520 --> 00:12:18.260
We invented it at the San Francisco branch.

00:12:18.260 --> 00:12:20.640
You can lift 100 kg without breaking a sweat.

00:12:22.030 --> 00:12:23.540
That's impressive.

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:25.060
Let's continue.

00:12:26.130 --> 00:12:30.090
Your father is Kisaragi Reiichiro. Your mother is Kisaragi Hana.

00:12:30.090 --> 00:12:32.340
They are both 40 years of age.

00:12:32.340 --> 00:12:36.530
They're freelance breakers and Lost Precious treasure hunters.

00:12:37.890 --> 00:12:38.940
Is that correct?

00:12:39.520 --> 00:12:40.360
Yes.

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:44.260
What do they have to do with Ryuji-kun's data?

00:12:46.710 --> 00:12:51.600
I simply wanted to confirm if his level 10 status was related to his genetics.

00:12:51.600 --> 00:12:55.030
It may affect his numbers.

00:12:55.030 --> 00:12:57.970
Those P and L numbers you were talking about...

00:12:57.970 --> 00:13:01.170
P is Physical. It measures your physical response.

00:13:01.170 --> 00:13:03.950
L is a measurement of your ability to use Lost Preciouses.

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:08.290
Your L value can be increased through emotion and concentration.

00:13:08.880 --> 00:13:12.030
Under ordinary circumstances, it remains at a low level.

00:13:12.460 --> 00:13:14.810
Your L value is currently 123.

00:13:15.900 --> 00:13:19.090
It's not low, but it's not particularly high either.

00:13:19.090 --> 00:13:20.140
I see.

00:13:20.590 --> 00:13:22.750
I'll have to measure your maximum value later.

00:13:23.040 --> 00:13:24.420
Maximum?

00:13:24.420 --> 00:13:28.190
Mao-chan, it's Ryuji-kun's birthday tomorrow.

00:13:28.550 --> 00:13:30.310
That's what he said.

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:34.370
It wouldn't be weird to give him something to thank him, would it?

00:13:36.550 --> 00:13:39.130
You really are cute.

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:40.700
Mao-chan.

00:13:41.330 --> 00:13:43.070
I'll give it my all, too.

00:13:43.070 --> 00:13:45.250
The "Plan to Take Back Kisaragi Ryuji" is a go.

00:13:45.250 --> 00:13:47.020
What are you talking about?

00:13:49.940 --> 00:13:51.550
How many hours do you sleep?

00:13:51.550 --> 00:13:53.750
Between six and eight, I think.

00:13:53.750 --> 00:13:55.490
How average.

00:13:55.490 --> 00:13:57.100
Most of your activity is during the day?

00:13:57.100 --> 00:13:58.900
I've got school.

00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:00.530
What is your experience with women?

00:14:00.530 --> 00:14:02.630
What? What did you...

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:07.800
Do you have experience with women?

00:14:08.960 --> 00:14:11.140
Ryuji, do you...

00:14:11.730 --> 00:14:13.970
Don't say that!

00:14:14.350 --> 00:14:15.650
Is something wrong?

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:19.110
You should keep your questions a little milder.

00:14:19.110 --> 00:14:22.380
Ryuji-kun, have you dated girls before?

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:23.640
No.

00:14:26.230 --> 00:14:29.850
Kisaragi Ryuji inexperienced.

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:32.920
Ryuji!

00:14:30.240 --> 00:14:31.150
Uh...

00:14:33.690 --> 00:14:38.880
I knew you wouldn't do anything even if you were surrounded by girls!

00:14:38.880 --> 00:14:41.510
I'm inexperienced, too!

00:14:42.320 --> 00:14:43.430
Excuse me.

00:14:45.180 --> 00:14:46.260
Now's my chance.

00:14:47.970 --> 00:14:48.730
"Likes"

00:14:51.210 --> 00:14:52.550
Aikawa-san?

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:02.060
According to the data, Ryuji-kun likes frogs.

00:15:02.290 --> 00:15:03.450
Frogs?

00:15:03.450 --> 00:15:05.990
Now you know what to get him as a present tomorrow.

00:15:05.990 --> 00:15:07.890
Thanks, Mao-chan.

00:15:08.980 --> 00:15:10.580
Let us begin the battle test.

00:15:11.020 --> 00:15:12.290
Battle?

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:17.360
As I explained earlier, a breaker's L value increases with emotion and concentration.

00:15:17.900 --> 00:15:21.220
In order to measure your maximum value, you must be placed under stress.

00:15:21.220 --> 00:15:23.410
In other words, a battle.

00:15:25.270 --> 00:15:26.610
This is your opponent.

00:15:33.230 --> 00:15:36.420
The San Francisco branch's hybrid weapon.

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:41.300
Neogolem.

00:15:46.710 --> 00:15:49.840
A humanoid weapon? What army came up with that?

00:15:50.160 --> 00:15:51.840
Eriko-san, what is that?

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:54.870
Science sure has made leaps and bounds.

00:15:54.870 --> 00:15:56.750
It's huge.

00:15:56.750 --> 00:15:58.570
I'm supposed to fight this?

00:15:58.570 --> 00:16:00.310
It's got a limiter.

00:16:00.310 --> 00:16:02.940
I can terminate the program if necessary.

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:06.730
A breaker's true power can only be observed in battle.

00:16:07.180 --> 00:16:08.610
That's what I want to see.

00:16:09.240 --> 00:16:11.460
Show me a miracle.

00:16:11.890 --> 00:16:13.820
Go, Neogolem!

00:16:16.860 --> 00:16:18.060
Stand back, everyone!

00:16:23.360 --> 00:16:24.630
Leave them to me!

00:16:25.680 --> 00:16:26.780
Thank you!

00:17:03.980 --> 00:17:05.110
That's odd.

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:07.790
Terminate program.

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:14.970
The limiter's been disconnected.

00:17:39.420 --> 00:17:40.450
Ryuji!

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:45.360
You can't let anyone find out you're a dragon.

00:17:45.360 --> 00:17:48.420
Don't use fire or use your wings.

00:18:00.340 --> 00:18:02.610
Ryuji, I'll save you!

00:18:06.650 --> 00:18:08.710
Run, Rose.

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:24.410
I'll stop it manually! You two get out of here!

00:18:45.180 --> 00:18:47.040
It's out of control! Run!

00:19:14.160 --> 00:19:16.630
A miracle...

00:19:24.790 --> 00:19:26.310
Ryuji!

00:19:28.400 --> 00:19:29.510
Engage.

00:19:54.800 --> 00:19:55.960
Ryuji!

00:19:59.060 --> 00:20:02.650
L5800? That's the highest recorded value.

00:20:03.370 --> 00:20:07.750
I'm sorry. I broke our promise and used my wings.

00:20:08.290 --> 00:20:09.330
I used fire, too.

00:20:12.190 --> 00:20:14.570
Thank you, Rose.

00:20:34.740 --> 00:20:37.710
The society really is amazing.

00:20:37.710 --> 00:20:40.110
I supposed I asked for a little much.

00:20:40.770 --> 00:20:43.560
I'm sorry for the trouble I caused.

00:20:43.560 --> 00:20:44.870
Don't worry about it.

00:20:44.870 --> 00:20:47.160
Don't I get an apology?

00:20:47.160 --> 00:20:50.380
Calming those girls down was a lot of work.

00:20:50.380 --> 00:20:55.160
Don't worry. I'll thank you by checking your data.

00:20:55.890 --> 00:20:58.790
I've decided to move into the room next to yours.

00:20:58.790 --> 00:21:01.820
There's much more I'd still like to examine.

00:21:03.680 --> 00:21:08.370
Morning. Under the guise of Kisaragi Ryuji's birthday party...

00:21:08.370 --> 00:21:12.090
we'll be having a mixer. Be sure to show up.

00:21:12.090 --> 00:21:14.060
You can come if you want, too.

00:21:14.680 --> 00:21:16.220
Are you crazy?

00:21:16.650 --> 00:21:17.780
Ryuji-kun.

00:21:19.070 --> 00:21:21.360
Happy birthday.

00:21:21.950 --> 00:21:23.560
What? Is this for me?

00:21:24.900 --> 00:21:26.140
Open it.

00:21:26.570 --> 00:21:27.550
Thanks.

00:21:28.910 --> 00:21:30.770
A frog!

00:21:31.200 --> 00:21:33.440
You don't like frogs?

00:21:33.440 --> 00:21:35.940
I hate them more than anything else!

00:21:37.900 --> 00:21:43.780
Oh? I mixed up his likes and dislikes during yesterday's interview.

00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:45.570
Why you...!

00:21:46.470 --> 00:21:48.290
Mao, why do you...

00:21:48.650 --> 00:21:51.710
School is so lively.

00:21:52.410 --> 00:21:53.800
What fun.

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:39.870
Next episode "Mirror of Truth"

00:23:25.750 --> 00:23:29.740
I've been thinking this anime doesn't have enough glasses.

00:23:29.740 --> 00:23:31.570
Glasses are a symbol of wisdom.

00:23:31.570 --> 00:23:33.460
The pinnacle of beauty.

00:23:33.460 --> 00:23:37.510
Which is why I, Bianca, will make appearances starting next episode.

00:23:37.510 --> 00:23:39.780
Prepare yourself for the glasses.
